      "product_summary": "Men wide toe box lace-up Mesh walking shoes for casual footwear assortments. Black Gray, White Orange and White Green are each offered in EU39-46. Photographs show segmented forefoot panels, angular side graphics, flecked laces, tongue and heel pull loops, and a contrasting sculpted sole. Upper is Mesh and outsole is MD + Rubber-plastic; separate midsole and lining compositions are unspecified. Send color, exact EU size mix, pair quantity, packaging needs and destination for a wholesale quotation. Samples, branding feasibility, costs and dispatch timing require order-specific confirmation.",
